      "statement": "The functional capture path diffs the real WAL against the last LTX position and writes the next L0 LTX file with atomic tmp→rename and a position cache; `verify` is the snapshot-on-continuity-break branch lattice and `checkpoint_if_needed` applies a 3-tier policy with anti-feedback flags.",
